flowchart LR
    User[控制调用方] --> API[云端 API]
    API --> Control[影子控制服务]
    Control --> SQL[(SQL 控制事实存储)]
    Control --> Broker[消息代理]
    Broker --> Engine[设备影子引擎]
    Engine <--> Local[(本地 Redis 缓存)]
    Engine --> Actuator[执行器]
    Actuator --> Device[设备或业务运行态]
    Device --> Reader[状态采集器]
    Reader --> Engine
    Engine --> Broker
    Broker --> Receiver[云端状态接收器]
    Receiver --> SQL
    Receiver --> Projection[异步展示态重算]
    SQL --> Query[事实与展示查询]
    Projection --> Query
    Query --> User
